Package: d3ballR
Title: Division III College Football Play-by-Play Scraper
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Sam", "Sclaver", email = "sclaversam@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scrapes and parses NCAA Division III college football play-by-play
    data from d3football.com into tidy, per-play tables. Fills a gap in the
    existing ecosystem (cfbfastR and CollegeFootballData cover only Division I),
    with initial focus on Centennial Conference teams.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
